W34B37 OT representation diagnosis — 2026-08-23

Command: gdb -q -batch -x w34b37_ot_target.gdb pc_port/build_native/xeno-port
Production binary was built after the uncommitted W34B37 writer and
ClearOTagR PSX_ADDR changes. No second-frame/backedge implementation was used.

Natural target:
  frame=916
  scheduler pass 2 = 29 executed / 0 missing
  upload pump transfers = 2 and 3, unknowns = 0
  DrawOTag entered naturally once
  g_PsxRam=0x54ee40
  DrawOTag p=0x5f2064, delta=0xa3224
  OT root=p-0xffc=0x5f1068, delta=0xa2228

Representative target words:
